    "LogSampleSummary": {
      "description": "The error-log sampling phase's own summary (log-patterns-v0\nplatform-contract \u00a71.2) -- run once, best-effort, after the commit.\n`error` is set only when the phase itself failed (D3: that never fails\nthe run, and every other field here just stays at its zero value).",
      "properties": {
        "workloads": {
          "default": 0,
          "title": "Workloads",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "pods": {
          "default": 0,
          "title": "Pods",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "bytes": {
          "default": 0,
          "title": "Bytes",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "groups": {
          "default": 0,
          "title": "Groups",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "forbiddenNamespaces": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Forbiddennamespaces",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "seconds": {
          "default": 0.0,
          "title": "Seconds",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "truncated": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Truncated",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "error": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Error"
        }
      },
      "title": "LogSampleSummary",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "description": "Output of the `discover` task -- `rw.discovery_summary.v1`. Bulk\ndata never rides this envelope (it goes straight to papi through the\nsync API, platform-contract \u00a73); this is only the run's own summary.\n\n`rollupSourcesUnavailable` maps a namespace name (or the cluster scope,\nkey `\"\"`) to the rollup source collections (`pod`, `replicaset`,\n`endpointslice`, `job`, `event`, `node`) that came back forbidden/failed\nthis run -- any rollup facet needing one of them was omitted rather than\nreported with a false empty/zero. Capped so a cluster with many\nforbidden namespaces can't bloat this envelope.",
  "properties": {
    "syncId": {
      "title": "Syncid",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "packDigest": {
